meta {
  name: 02 Ready
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/interface/modules/custom_modules/oe-module-clinical-copilot/public/ready.php
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.dependencies.database: eq ok
  res.body.dependencies.openai: eq ok
  res.body.dependencies.sidecar: eq ok
}

docs {
  Probes the database, OpenAI, Langfuse and (Week 2) the sidecar's own /ready,
  each bounded to 2 s. 503 if the database or OpenAI is down; 200 "degraded"
  if only Langfuse or the sidecar is (briefings still work; extraction and
  guideline evidence do not). Cached 60 s. Contract: ready.response.
}
